Thus we need to allocate dispatch slot for each entity before dispatch, then after dispatch it becomes available again.

Thus we need to allocate dispatch slot for origin_availability_alpha, dispatch it, slot free, allocate for destination_availability_alpha, dispatch, slot free, allocate for shift_candidate_alpha, dispatch.

